The iOS-specific BTap.m `__APPLE__` branch was modified to route outbound
packets through `ctun2socks_output` (defined in ctun2socks_bridge.c) instead
of Potatso's `TunnelInterface` Objective-C class, so this target carries no
Objective-C dependency on the host app.
